Team,

Summer is here and I know many of you are planning vacations and shuffling schedules. A quick reminder so we don't have empty floors on Fridays:

1. If you're hybrid, you still need your two office days every week, even in summer. If your department asks for more than two, follow your department.
2. A week where you take PTO on one of your office days: swap it with your manager, don't drop it.
3. Working from a vacation rental is fine if it's in Kendry or Ossary and you're on the VPN. Anywhere else, ask HR first.

Also, the Tamsworth cafeteria will close at 1:30 in July and August.

Enjoy the sunshine,
Ilse

